## File Map

### UI Layer
- `ui/screens/PlayerScreen.kt` - Main playback UI.
- `ui/components/GestureOverlay.kt` - Swipe detection layer.
- `ui/components/EqualizerView.kt` - EQ controls.
- `ui/screens/LibraryScreen.kt` - File browser.
- `ui/screens/PlaylistScreen.kt` - Queue management.

### Controller Layer
- `player/PowerfulPlayer.kt` - ExoPlayer wrapper.
- `player/PlayerViewModel.kt` - UDF state management.
- `player/renderers/CustomRenderersFactory.kt` - Rendering logic switch.
- `player/renderers/FFmpegVideoRenderer.kt` - Native video fallback.
- `player/renderers/FFmpegAudioRenderer.kt` - Native audio fallback.

### Native Engine (C++/JNI)
- `jni/FFmpegBridge.cpp` - JNI entry points.
- `jni/native/DecoderCore.cpp` - FFmpeg AVCodec wrapper.
- `jni/native/RingBuffer.cpp` - Decoded frame storage.
- `jni/native/AudioProcessor.cpp` - PCM normalization.
- `jni/CMakeLists.txt` - Native build config.

### Data Layer
- `data/local/MediaDatabase.kt` - Room DB.
- `data/local/MediaEntity.kt` - Media metadata entity.
- `data/local/MediaDao.kt` - DB queries.
- `data/repository/MediaRepository.kt` - Disk scanner and DB coordinator.

